-;WHEN THE QUIT MESSAGE IS ACKNOWLEDGED AND SUBMIT, GUN, CLAMP AND PIN ARE OK AGAIN (2026-10-06)
+;FOLD ROUTINE INFO
+;**********************************************************
+;* Interrupt routine: gun not open, clamp not open or pin
+;* not retracted while the robot moves in the welder.
+;* All OK again when the routine runs (short signal drop,
+;* e.g. door opened with the robot stopped): no stop.
+;* Otherwise the robot stops, message, and continues when
+;* the message is acknowledged and all is OK again.
+;**********************************************************
+;ENDFOLD
